            <div xml:id="d155">

                <pb facs="0285" n="195" xml:id="pg195"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">422.11G93/1081: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hartman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-03-10T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 10,
                                1920—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>9. Your March 6, 3 p.m.</p>
                <p>Ecuadoran Minister today informed Department that he had received a cable from
                    President of Ecuador to the effect that daily deposits had been resumed. Verify
                    this information and cable Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
